    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gohery Properties are delighted to bring to the market this beautiful 3 bed located in the heart of Oranmore – a very central and most sought-after location at Abhainn na Ri on the Dublin Road in Oranmor village.\r\n\r\nThis homely 3 bed allows easy access to all Oranmore facilities (Schools, shops, bus routes, restaurants – and is close to Renville Park, Sailing club and Galway Bay golf resort. This delightful home with easily maintained garden offers an excellent opportunity to move to this sought after village centre location - a ready to walk into home. Currently comprising main entrance hall, main reception, kitchen dining living, 3 bedrooms, main bathroom and master bedroom ensuite - The property has the benefit of double-glazed PVC windows, gas fired central heating, modern kitchen and bathrooms, modern decor and a beautiful south est facing rear garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "⭐ 3-bedroom village centre property\r\n⭐ Gas central heating system – B 3 BER – Solid fuel stove in main reception\r\n⭐ Extends to 107.65 sq mts (1,157 sq.ft.)  accommodation\r\n⭐ Not overlooked to elevation with parking to elevation and green space immediately in front\r\n⭐ Rare opportunity to acquire a strong home in such a central location\r\n⭐ Oranmore has easy access to both Galway City & Motorway access to all routes and bus / train routes at regular intervals\r\n⭐ Easily maintained rear garden with steeltech shed"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      }
